{
 "lines": [
  {
   "shot": "1",
   "at": 1.2,
   "text": "We've talked about Portugal for two years. Tonight I'm actually looking."
  },
  {
   "shot": "2",
   "at": 7,
   "text": "Twenty tabs. And every one says something different."
  },
  {
   "shot": "4",
   "at": 17,
   "text": "Where do we even start? Lisbon? Porto? The coast?"
  },
  {
   "shot": "5",
   "at": 22.2,
   "text": "And what do two million francs actually get us, once the taxes hit?"
  },
  {
   "shot": "6",
   "at": 28.7,
   "text": "Can we even do this from here?"
  },
  {
   "shot": "7",
   "at": 34.5,
   "text": "Who's actually building there?"
  },
  {
   "shot": "8",
   "at": 43.4,
   "text": "That one."
  },
  {
   "shot": "9",
   "at": 46.1,
   "text": "Can someone just show it to us properly?"
  },
  {
   "shot": "10",
   "at": 52.4,
   "text": "And we'll need a lawyer. And a bank."
  },
  {
   "shot": "11",
   "at": 57,
   "text": "Okay. That's a start."
  }
 ],
